  "description": "CR 601.3 / 715.3c / 603.7c / 400.7a: Summon: Brynhildr's chapter I exiles the top card of your library, playable only during a turn you put a lore counter on the Saga; its chapter II gives the next creature spell you cast this turn haste until end of turn",
  "note": "Chapter I exiles Shock on turn 1. Alice cannot cast it on Bob's turn 2, though in its upkeep she proliferates a lore counter onto History of Benalia (another Saga, whose turn 1 counter made a Knight and whose chapter III this one fires), nor in her turn 3 or turn 5 upkeeps, each with an untapped Mountain, since no lore counter has been put on the Saga that turn; the +1/+1 counter Battlegrowth puts on it in the turn 3 upkeep is no lore counter. On turn 3 chapter II arms its trigger: neither Lightning Bolt, a noncreature spell, nor Bob's Ambush Viper, flashed in response, uses it; Grizzly Bears, the next creature spell, gains haste and attacks; Runeclaw Bear, cast after, does not and cannot. On Bob's turn 4 the Bears' haste has ended. Turn 5's counter fires chapter III and the Saga is sacrificed, yet that is a turn a lore counter was put on it, so Shock is cast then.",
